Z||000000||loafer87gt||09-05-2001||12:06 AM||||After 20 years of faithful service my 81 tercel just fell apart. The rear control arms and the whole rear suspension rusted entirely off the car. I took the vehicle to the Toyota dealership and the cost is $1300(!!!!) bucks for the control arms. I was all excited when I first called in as I guess their was a recall for the item, but I later discovered that to get the recall I had to replace all my other worn parts on the car with new Toyota parts and replace the cracked windshield etc. to bring it up to their safety standards. Murphys law, school starts up on Thursday and I'm without a car again. Just had to vent a little  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||9
